{"id":3471,"bangumiId":3471,"type":2,"name":"刀語","name_cn":"刀语","date":"2010-01-25","year":"2010","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/73/51/3471_974gQ.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/73/51/3471_974gQ.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/73/51/3471_974gQ.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/73/51/3471_974gQ.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/73/51/3471_974gQ.jpg"},"summary":"在地图上没有记载的无人岛・不承岛，岛上生活着不使用刀的剑术・虚刀流第七代当家鑢七花与其姐姐鑢七实。\r\n幼年时随父亲漂流到此岛上，生活至今已经20年了。\r\n在父亲去世后，本以为在这个世上已经没有人记得他们了。某日，一位自称咎的奇策士突然来到岛上拜访。\r\n她是为了收集传说中的锻刀师・四季崎记纪终其一生冶炼的十二套变刀体，而来求助于虚刀流的当家七花。\r\n但是，在他们的交谈中突然遭到了袭击！袭击者是真庭忍军十二头领中的真庭蝙蝠。七花愤怒地追着蝙蝠而去……。\r\n在世外桃源之地长大、对外界一无所知的剑士鑢七花的旅途开始了。在前方等待他的究竟会是地狱般的决战抑或是命悬一线的……恋爱泥潭！？","rating":{"rank":654,"total":4472,"count":{"1":8,"2":7,"3":7,"4":34,"5":92,"6":419,"7":1230,"8":1880,"9":602,"10":193},"score":7.6},"collection":{"on_hold":746,"dropped":250,"wish":3069,"collect":6095,"doing":601},"tags":[{"name":"西尾维新","count":1450,"total_count":26220},{"name":"刀语","count":830,"total_count":832},{"name":"TV","count":517,"total_count":1441976},{"name":"2010年1月","count":493,"total_count":5732},{"name":"轻小说改","count":414,"total_count":508935},{"name":"WHITEFOX","count":364,"total_count":34474},{"name":"时代剧","count":324,"total_count":794},{"name":"2010","count":310,"total_count":44238},{"name":"傲娇","count":283,"total_count":13028},{"name":"天然呆","count":215,"total_count":1162},{"name":"废言帝","count":200,"total_count":201},{"name":"战斗","count":157,"total_count":488059},{"name":"中原麻衣","count":125,"total_count":2900},{"name":"古装","count":118,"total_count":294},{"name":"刀語","count":104,"total_count":104},{"name":"小说改","count":95,"total_count":167075}],"eps":12,"total_episodes":12,"aliases":["刀语","刀語"],"sourceType":"bibliography","nsfw":false,"annualRank":28,"sourceYear":2010,"sourceUrl":"https://bgm.tv/subject/3471","popularity":10761}